{"kind":"stack","id":"s1","title":"Animals and nutrition: what living things need to eat","theme":{"background":"#fdf6e3","foreground":"#1d3557","font":"Arial, sans-serif"}}
{"kind":"card","card":{"id":"c1","kind":"flash","elements":[{"type":"text","id":"c1-t","content":"Nutrition"},{"type":"text","id":"c1-e","content":"Nutrition is the food and drink a living thing needs to grow, move and stay healthy."},{"type":"button","id":"c1-b","label":"Next Card","actions":[{"type":"goto","cardId":"c2"}]}],"actions":[]}}
{"kind":"card","card":{"id":"c2","kind":"quiz","elements":[{"type":"text","id":"c2-q","content":"Which of these can make its own food?"},{"type":"button","id":"c2-a","label":"A plant, using sunlight","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":1},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c3"}]},{"type":"button","id":"c2-b","label":"A cow","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":0},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c3"}]},{"type":"button","id":"c2-c","label":"A dog","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":0},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c3"}]}],"actions":[]}}
{"kind":"card","card":{"id":"c3","kind":"quiz","elements":[{"type":"text","id":"c3-q","content":"Where do animals get their nutrition from?"},{"type":"button","id":"c3-a","label":"From the food they eat","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":1},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c4"}]},{"type":"button","id":"c3-b","label":"From sunlight on their skin","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":0},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c4"}]},{"type":"button","id":"c3-c","label":"From the soil under them","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":0},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c4"}]}],"actions":[]}}
{"kind":"card","card":{"id":"c4","kind":"story","elements":[{"type":"image","picto":"tree"},{"type":"text","id":"c4-t","content":"You are lost in the forest and very hungry. Which path do you take?"},{"type":"button","id":"c4-a","label":"Follow the path to the berry bushes","actions":[{"type":"goto","cardId":"c5"}]},{"type":"button","id":"c4-b","label":"Follow the path to the river","actions":[{"type":"goto","cardId":"c6"}]}],"actions":[]}}
{"kind":"card","card":{"id":"c5","kind":"story","elements":[{"type":"text","id":"c5-t","content":"Some berries are safe to eat, but you must check which ones. Eating the wrong food could make you ill. Good nutrition needs safe food."},{"type":"button","id":"c5-b","label":"Continue","actions":[{"type":"goto","cardId":"c7"}]}],"actions":[]}}
{"kind":"card","card":{"id":"c6","kind":"story","elements":[{"type":"text","id":"c6-t","content":"You find fish in the river. A fish is food for you, and you need food to grow and stay strong."},{"type":"button","id":"c6-b","label":"Continue","actions":[{"type":"goto","cardId":"c7"}]}],"actions":[]}}
{"kind":"card","card":{"id":"c7","kind":"quiz","elements":[{"type":"text","id":"c7-q","content":"Do humans need the right amount of nutrition?"},{"type":"button","id":"c7-a","label":"Yes, to grow and stay healthy","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":1},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c8"}]},{"type":"button","id":"c7-b","label":"No, any amount is fine","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":0},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c8"}]},{"type":"button","id":"c7-c","label":"Only when they are ill","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":0},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c8"}]}],"actions":[]}}
{"kind":"card","card":{"id":"c8","kind":"flash","elements":[{"type":"text","id":"c8-t","content":"Balanced diet"},{"type":"text","id":"c8-e","content":"A balanced diet includes the right types and amounts of food for a healthy body."},{"type":"button","id":"c8-b","label":"Next Card","actions":[{"type":"goto","cardId":"c9"}]}],"actions":[]}}
{"kind":"card","card":{"id":"c9","kind":"quiz","elements":[{"type":"text","id":"c9-q","content":"Which animal must eat food to get nutrition?"},{"type":"button","id":"c9-a","label":"A lion","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":1},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c10"}]},{"type":"button","id":"c9-b","label":"A tree","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":0},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c10"}]},{"type":"button","id":"c9-c","label":"A rock","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":0},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c10"}]}],"actions":[]}}
{"kind":"card","card":{"id":"c10","kind":"quiz","elements":[{"type":"text","id":"c10-q","content":"Can an animal make its own food from sunlight, like a plant?"},{"type":"button","id":"c10-a","label":"No, it must eat","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":1},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c11"}]},{"type":"button","id":"c10-b","label":"Yes, every day","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":0},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c11"}]},{"type":"button","id":"c10-c","label":"Yes, but only in summer","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":0},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c11"}]}],"actions":[]}}
{"kind":"card","card":{"id":"c11","kind":"quiz","elements":[{"type":"text","id":"c11-q","content":"Which food gives an animal the nutrition it needs?"},{"type":"button","id":"c11-a","label":"A varied diet of plants and meat","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":1},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c12"}]},{"type":"button","id":"c11-b","label":"Only sweets","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":0},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c12"}]},{"type":"button","id":"c11-c","label":"Only water","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":0},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c12"}]}],"actions":[]}}
{"kind":"card","card":{"id":"c12","kind":"end","elements":[{"type":"text","id":"c12-h","content":"Well done: you finished the nutrition lesson!"},{"type":"text","id":"c12-m","content":"Animals, including humans, cannot make their own food, so they must eat the right types and amounts."}],"actions":[]}}
